```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Reinforcing Loop 1: Pollution Trap"
        PM[High PM2.5] -->|Respiratory illness| Health[Poor Health]
        Health -->|Missed work| Productivity[Lower Productivity]
        Productivity -->|Less income| Poverty[Poverty]
        Poverty -->|Cheap fuels, no alternatives| PM

        style PM fill:#ff6b6b
        style Poverty fill:#ff6b6b
    end

    subgraph "Balancing Loop 1: Political Pressure"
        AQI[Severe AQI] -->|Visibility, fear| Alarm[Public Alarm]
        Alarm -->|Media coverage| Pressure[Political Pressure]
        Pressure -->|Emergency measures| Action[Policy Action]
        Action -->|Emissions ↓| AQI_Down[AQI Decreases]
        AQI_Down -.->|Negative feedback| AQI

        style Action fill:#51cf66
        style AQI_Down fill:#51cf66
    end

    subgraph "Reinforcing Loop 2: Meteorological"
        PM2[PM2.5 in air] -->|Blocks sunlight| Cooling[Surface Cooling]
        Cooling -->|Stable atmosphere| Inversion[Temperature Inversion]
        Inversion -->|Traps pollution| PM2

        style Inversion fill:#ffa94d
    end

    subgraph "Balancing Loop 2: Compliance Fatigue"
        Restrictions[Strict Restrictions] -->|Initially| Compliance[High Compliance]
        Compliance -->|Effective| AQI_Better[AQI Improves]
        AQI_Better -->|Complacency| Fatigue[Compliance Fatigue]
        Fatigue -.->|Negative feedback| Compliance

        style Compliance fill:#74c0fc
    end

    subgraph "Reinforcing Loop 3: Social Contagion (Burning)"
        Farmer1[Farmer Burns] -->|Neighbors observe| Norm[Social Norm]
        Norm -->|"Everyone's doing it"| Farmer2[More Farmers Burn]
        Farmer2 -->|Reinforces| Farmer1

        style Farmer2 fill:#ffd43b
    end
```
